  "html": "<p>Wolves of various types are seldom found alone, but usually accompany either <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Whiskers\" title=\"Category:Whiskers\">Whiskers</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Oroks\" title=\"Category:Oroks\">Oroks</a> in various dungeons.\n</p>\n\n<div id=\"mw-pages\">\n<h2>Articles in category \"Wolves\"</h2>\n<p>There are 9 articles in this category.\n</p><table width=\"100%\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td>\n<h3>A</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Abominable_Snow_Dog\" title=\"Abominable Snow Dog\">Abominable Snow Dog</a></li></ul>\n<h3>E</h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Embercore_hound\" title=\"Embercore hound\">Embercore hound</a></span></li></ul>\n<h3>R</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Rat's_Best_Friend\" title=\"Rat's Best Friend\">Rat's Best Friend</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>R cont.</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Rattle_Guard_Dog\" title=\"Rattle Guard Dog\">Rattle Guard Dog</a></li></ul>\n<h3>S</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Snow_Monsters_Best_Friend\" title=\"Snow Monsters Best Friend\">Snow Monsters Best Friend</a></li><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Snow_Warg\" title=\"Snow Warg\">Snow Warg</a></span></li></ul>\n<h3>W</h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Warg\" title=\"Warg\">Warg</a></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>W cont.</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wolf\" title=\"Wolf\">Wolf</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wolf_Pup\" title=\"Wolf Pup\">Wolf Pup</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n</tr></table>\n</div>\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
